            {
              "answer": "yiz",
              "why": "The last vowel is ı, so the ending is *-yız*."
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "explain": "Vowel at the end (ı), so buffer *y*, then `-Iz` with ı: *Kanadalıyız*."
    },
